{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2033bdab3bd520dbdc20a0423475a93ba8035795337af58c5ce5bfca174cc47a", "ja": "（今日はユニット公演の写真撮影……昴は新しい\n衣装にも慣れたみたいで、撮影はスムーズに終わった）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄用在团体公演的照片……\n昴好像也已经习惯新服装，拍摄顺利结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "91cec647f50705e978ea1e91746f4f1f9cef5d4366958ffb935c054d4dd23ac1", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\nなぁなぁ、今日の撮影どうだった？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n欸欸，今天拍得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "31cb2f28e1c10b9a30e382252322a9cbf619c43643d154260e4ca86c17613b6c", "ja": "お疲れさま、昴。うん、良かったと思う！\n昴も手応えを感じてるんじゃないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，昴。嗯，我觉得很棒！\n昴应该也颇有信心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "19991070069b1da9b5f1c59a64cf36d53f24ae6dace682b17d6927bf8197d01d", "ja": "へへっ、やっぱそう？　オレ、自分でもけっこう\nうまくできたんじゃないかなって気がしたんだ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，果然是这样吗？\n我自己也觉得好像拍得很棒呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "a85a625b4033b0a1c984b1a0e3bf9522ed5c54210e6b30ecb4ef8840e4121ca8", "ja": "ポーズとかも、キマってたろ？\nあれ、百合子に教えてもらったんだぜ♪", "zh": "像是姿势那些我也都做得很到位吧？\n那可是百合子教我的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b0407cc571b6db0d0befa7071e2c66d75da45ab9785f0775e58c30f511b2cc45", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。\n確かに、ゴシックな雰囲気がよく出てたよ。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊～\n的确很有歌德风的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "90f94a3785705dcacf5e73f512fff7a2c1dfd63645c23ffda477976c291b5f6f", "ja": "だろ！？　オレ、ホントのこと言うと、\n今でも頽廃？とか、よく意味わかんないんだけどさー。", "zh": "对吧！？老实说，\n我到现在还是不太懂颓废是什么意思～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "e99a3b0905d92fea1468118e9355618bb84ba09019aee286144c0f639de4ab40", "ja": "なんか、言葉とか難しいし。だから、\nクールでカッコいい感じにすればいいのかなって。", "zh": "总觉得这个词很难懂，所以我就想，\n只要表现出又酷又帅的感觉，应该就可以了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1008_p", "source_sha256": "170d74ba8eeeb6431a84999fa4de30e2a79cb5dcfe810a5355d9f8ee6cce38ee", "ja": "そうだな。明るくて元気な雰囲気よりは、\n近くなると思う。頑張ったな、昴！", "zh": "是啊，那样应该比开朗活泼的氛围还要贴切。\n你很努力呢，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "1149cf0c8b05146d2416c6363e016f4fca15a18a2e3d7eb1a502a4ca7d747b0d", "ja": "うん！　あ、それと……百合子が言うには、\n役になりきるといいんだってさ。", "zh": "嗯！啊，还有……照百合子的说法是……\n要彻底成为角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "29d8081290f40d23fc2ecab2a7d2746d6950a8a7c3583b4b6a5d7fe4b821bad0", "ja": "だからオレ、撮影中も心の中で、\n百合子の小説のセリフを読んだりしてたんだ！", "zh": "所以拍摄的时候，\n我也在心中默念百合子的小说里的台词喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f3f39143de859f93d407fc602dec30211bf9a3ce25bf4850ccc4585ef6525a6a", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。\nどの部分のセリフだ？", "zh": "哦，原来你还下了这样的功夫啊。\n是哪一段台词呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "b800cfdb95162eef0e2c3e28489feae0b930c843bec383c486ba3a862a3b21ad", "ja": "それはもちろん、アレだろ！\nえっと、オレ……じゃなかった。", "zh": "当然是那一段啰！\n我想想～我……不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "ebd2f164a6dd5a48534808ec50e1575829ce4213359fa3e330ca0eb1cf8e6da2", "ja": "私たちは、背く！\nそして逆光の運命を、不可逆の縛鎖を砕く！", "zh": "我们会起身反抗！\n然后终结逆光的命运、摧毁不可逆的枷锁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "b5113d84c727df4446f0c9ad8dfbc7fef437ac16b881f21742a137da9e7c2bf7", "ja": "へへっ、どーだ！　大したもんだろ？", "zh": "嘿嘿，怎么样！是不是很了不起啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "0346d1147ce9f7304f54b058a6ad84490983d7997ec8b4a996c659d5ea08a5c4", "ja": "は、反応ぐらいしてよ、{$P$}！\n黙って見てられると、恥ずかしいじゃん！", "zh": "给、给点反应啊，{$P$}！\n你这样静静地看着我，我很害羞耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1017_p", "source_sha256": "61b9333516ab5daeefd0dc3b94cf91945f9aeba186b04b29ee1c4142dd8ca42b", "ja": "あ、ごめん。つい見入ってしまって……。\nでも、すごく良かったよ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉，我不小心看呆了……\n不过，真的很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "553c68a517e70e0822c91971d65ea3c3183ce64a6474c4b33cd7664223c027e6", "ja": "マジで？　オレ、案外\nこういう方向でもいけたりするのかな？", "zh": "真的吗？\n我说不定也可以走这个路线？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1019_p", "source_sha256": "80132e1c5a46fb3e646f62586b5a3a24441ffb2176403f706ed838d7bca18aa7", "ja": "そうかもしれない。昴の才能を引き出してくれた\n百合子に、感謝しなくちゃな！", "zh": "搞不好可以喔，要感谢把昴的才华\n激发出来的百合子才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "3d1b9173645f6c4041dc577516a12811e899bf47f9654e5dd0390478177de9ff", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}にも\nほめてもらったし、ライブもがんばるぜ！", "zh": "嗯！既然都得到{$P$}的称赞了，\n演唱会我也要加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0123_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "bc98a433aceebf6429dc5a09b0c29a68babd53e7bc324bae9c109bdcaba43eb3", "ja": "オレ、最高にカッコいいライブにするからさ。\nまた感想、聞かせてくれよな！", "zh": "我会带来一场最帅气的演唱会，\n到时再让我听听你的感想喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
